# Talk recordings — 1.6 GB, kept in OneDrive but deliberately NOT in git.
#
# These were originally committed via Git LFS and removed again in ac299b0.
# Putting them back would exceed GitHub's free LFS allowance (1 GB storage,
# 1 GB/month bandwidth), and GitHub Pages does not resolve LFS pointers, so
# they could not be served from here anyway. YouTube embeds on /talks do that job.
